<%# Hero, split: what this place is and the one thing to do, beside a photo. On phones the words
    come first and the photo is shorter, so the heading and the button fit the first screen. Put the business's real offer in the heading, not a slogan; replace the
    photo box with image_tag (bin/images) and the facts row with what visitors weigh up (rating,
    district, opening hours). Structure after HyperUI banners (MIT, see CREDITS.md). %>
<section class="bg-canvas">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-8 px-4 py-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12 md:py-20">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-brand-700 uppercase">Tiệm nail · Quận 3</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl leading-tight font-bold text-balance text-ink md:text-5xl">
        Móng đẹp trong <span class="text-brand-600">45 phút</span>, không phải chờ
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Sơn gel, đắp bột, vẽ móng theo mẫu. Đặt giờ trước, đến là làm ngay.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="#dat-lich" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-brand-600 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-brand-500">
          <%= icon "calendar-check", size: 18 %> Đặt lịch
        </a>
        <a href="#bang-gia" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-ink ring-1 ring-line transition ring-inset hover:bg-surface-muted">
          Xem bảng giá
        </a>
      </div>

      <dl class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><%= icon "star", size: 16, class: "text-accent" %><dt class="sr-only">Đánh giá</dt><dd><strong class="text-ink">4,9</strong> <span class="text-muted">(320 đánh giá)</span></dd></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><%= icon "clock", size: 16, class: "text-muted" %><dt class="sr-only">Giờ mở cửa</dt><dd class="text-muted">9:00 – 21:00 mỗi ngày</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-200 to-brand-500 md:aspect-[4/5]">
      <%# image_tag "stock/…", alt: "…", class: "size-full object-cover" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
